Libraries here and src/libraries/morai_mpc contain the externally supplied
Autoware AI numerical port, amathutils and qpOASES. Calculation bodies are copied
from the source branch; only include paths are relocated. lane.hpp preserves the
source port's original pose/twist reference types.

Custom lateral adapter, longitudinal MPC, OSQP SQP adapter, parameter structures,
steering predictor and prediction/curvature helpers are folded into
cores/morai_mpc.hpp. Startup coefficient validation is in parameters/morai_mpc.hpp.
OSQP 0.6.3 C API and Eigen are external dependencies, not copied custom libraries.
Licenses are preserved in ../licenses/.
